{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and Grab Object     or     Perform Task     if detected;     if approached, grab and move; else, check properties and perform task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectAtReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectIdentified    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />",
    "BT": {
